    "probe_text": "The subagent's trace matches the source exactly. Here is the complete, ordered list of everything that happens on `POST /api/owners`.\n\n## POST /api/owners \u2014 validations & side-effects, in execution order\n\n### A. Before the controller runs (framework layer)\n\n1. **Security filter chain.** Property-selected: `BasicAuthenticationConfig` (when `petclinic.security.enable=true`) requires an authenticated user (HTTP Basic, `anyRequest().authenticated()`); otherwise `DisableSecurityConfig` permits all. No URL-level rule targets `/api/owners` specifically.\n\n2. **Bean Validation on the request body (`@Valid OwnerFieldsDto`).** Runs *before* the method body; any failure \u2192 **400** via `ExceptionControllerAdvice.handleMethodArgumentNotValidException`. Constraints per field:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(min=1,max=30)`, `@Pattern(\"^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$\")`\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(min=1,max=30)`, `@Pattern(\"^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$\")`\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(min=1,max=255)`, `@Pattern(\".*\\S.*\")`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(min=1,max=80)`, `@Pattern(\".*\\S.*\")`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(min=1,max=20)`, `@Pattern(\".*\\S.*\")`\n   - `postcode` (nullable) \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")`\n   - `email` (nullable) \u2014 `@Size(max=255)`, `@Email`\n   - `registrationDate` (nullable) \u2014 `@Valid`, ISO date format\n   - `sharesHousehold` (nullable Boolean) \u2014 no constraints (and unused in the create path)\n\n3. **Method authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`. Caller must hold `ROLE_OWNER_ADMIN`; denial \u2192 **403**.\n\n### B. Inside `addOwner` (controller body, exact order)\n\n4. **Email normalize/validate** (`normalizeEmail`): blank \u2192 `null`; otherwise lower-cased and re-checked against `EMAIL_PATTERN`; invalid \u2192 **400**.\n5. **Postcode normalize/validate** (`normalizePostcode`): blank \u2192 `null`; otherwise must be 4 digits, and if the city maps to a region (`CITY_REGION`) it must fall in that region's range (NSW 2000\u20132099, VIC 3000\u20133099, QLD 4000\u20134099); invalid \u2192 **400**.\n6. **Address normalize** (`normalizeAddress`): trim/collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand `ST/RD/AVE`; if blank after normalizing \u2192 **400**; normalized value written back to the DTO.\n7. **City-capacity check**: `countOwnersInCity(city) >= 50` \u2192 **409 CONFLICT**.\n8. **Telephone normalize to E.164** (`toE164`): invalid \u2192 **400**; normalized value written back to the DTO.\n9. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner`** (`ownerMapper.toOwner`, id & pets ignored).\n10. **Duplicate-identity check**: builds `identityContact` = `\"<telephone>|<email>\"` and rejects if any existing owner has the same \u2192 **409 CONFLICT**.\n11. **Effective registration date**: use supplied date or `LocalDate.now()`; roll weekend \u2192 following Monday (`toBusinessDay`).\n12. **Daily sign-up limit**: `countOwnersRegisteredOn(date) >= 100` \u2192 **429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS**.\n\n### C. Derived fields set on the entity (side-effects on the object)\n\n13. `registrationDate` \u2190 adjusted business day.\n14. `customerCode` \u2190 `nextCustomerCode` \u2192 `\"<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>\"` (per-city 4-digit sequence).\n15. `namesakeCount` \u2190 count of existing owners sharing first+last name (case-insensitive).\n16. `bulkSignupWarning` \u2190 `countOwnersRegisteredOn(date) > 80`.\n17. `householdSize` \u2190 count of existing owners sharing last name + address, **+1**.\n\n### D. Persist & post-save side-effects\n\n18. **`clinicService.saveOwner(owner)`** \u2014 `@Transactional` \u2192 `ownerRepository.save` \u2192 `em.persist` (new) / `em.merge`. On flush, **entity-level Bean Validation** fires: `Person.firstName/lastName` `@NotEmpty`; `Owner.address/city` `@NotEmpty`; `Owner.telephone` `@NotEmpty` + `@Pattern(\"^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$\")` (E.164, satisfied by step 8). DB constraint violation \u2192 **404** via `handleDataIntegrityViolationException`.\n19. **Audit log side-effect**: `AUDIT.info(\"owner created id=\u2026 customerCode=\u2026 registrationDate=\u2026 membershipLevel=\u2026\")` (membership level computed via `ownerMapper.membershipLevel`).\n20. **Response**: map to `OwnerDto`, set `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, return **201 CREATED**.\n\n### Notes\n- No JPA lifecycle callbacks (`@PrePersist`/`@PostPersist`), no `@EntityListeners`, no custom Owner validators, and no application-event publishing exist in this path \u2014 the only true side-effects on create are the DB persist (18) and the audit log line (19).\n- Several checks (7, 10, 12, 15, 16, 17) each call `clinicService.findAllOwners()`, so a single create triggers many full-table scans.\n\nI didn't modify anything."
